    "description": {
      "value": "You create a replenishing protective bubble of fresh, temperate air around the target. The shell of air enables the target to breathe even underwater or in a vacuum, protects from severe cold and heat, and grants a +1 status bonus to the target's saves against inhaled dangers such as inhaled poisons and cloudkill."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (6th): The bubble lasts until your next preparation.\n\nHeightened (8th): The bubble lasts until your next preparation, protects against extreme cold and heat, and grants a +2 status bonus instead of +1."
